          "cultural_impact": "Rosalía helped bring flamenco-derived sounds into mainstream global pop, recontextualizing traditional Spanish music within contemporary urbano, pop and experimental frameworks. Her work has earned major international awards, opened doors for Spanish-language and flamenco-descended music on global stages, inspired conversations about cultural preservation and appropriation, and influenced a new wave of Latin and Spanish artists blending heritage with modern production.",
